{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "One mapping from every chain in data/chains.json to the wasm derive_report row that carries its canonical address. `format` names the address encoding; `wifComparable` is true only when the desktop WIF version byte equals the Bitcoin mainnet WIF byte that derive_report exposes (0x80). A chain with `desktop: false` is not registered in the desktop chain descriptor table.",
